# but this guards against a stray full-profile copy).
**/mozilla/**/cookies.sqlite
**/mozilla/**/logins.json
**/mozilla/**/key4.db
**/mozilla/**/cert9.db
**/mozilla/**/places.sqlite
**/mozilla/**/sessionstore*
**/mozilla/**/storage/
